2026-08-12 — fetch pipeline mothballed (pinnacle P0).

proudtek.com now serves THIS Astro build. `npm run fetch` (and the
`build:site` script that calls it) would re-crawl our own output and
overwrite the WordPress-era snapshots in src/data/pages/ that editorial
pages still use as their chrome/fallback source (index.json included).

Delete this file or run with FORCE_FETCH=1 only if you are intentionally
re-pointing SITE_ORIGIN at a different source site.
